    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128478409\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Types of, in Memory</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128478410\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/baptism?lang=eng\">Baptism</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/sacrament?lang=eng\">Sacrament</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/symbolism?lang=eng\">Symbolism</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478411\" id=\"p1\">Jesus took <span class=\"key-word\">bread</span> … and said, Take, eat; this is my body, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/26?lang=eng&amp;id=p26#p26\">Matt. 26:26</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p22#p22\">Mark 14:22</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478412\" id=\"p2\"><span class=\"key-word\">first day</span> of the week, they came unto the sepulchre, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/16?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">Mark 16:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478413\" id=\"p3\">this do in <span class=\"key-word\">remembrance</span> of me, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/22?lang=eng&amp;id=p19#p19\">Luke 22:19</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">1 Cor. 11:24</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478414\" id=\"p4\"><span class=\"key-word\">bread</span> that I will give is my flesh, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p51#p51\">John 6:51</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478415\" id=\"p5\">first day of the week, when the disciples came together to break <span class=\"key-word\">bread</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/20?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">Acts 20:7</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478416\" id=\"p6\">planted together in the <span class=\"key-word\">likeness</span> of his death, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rom/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">Rom. 6:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478417\" id=\"p7\"><span class=\"key-word\">Buried</span> with him in baptism, wherein also ye are risen, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/col/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">Col. 2:12</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478418\" id=\"p8\">offer up spiritual <span class=\"key-word\">sacrifices</span>, acceptable to God, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-pet/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">1 Pet. 2:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478419\" id=\"p9\">I was in the Spirit on the <span class=\"key-word\">Lord’s day</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rev/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">Rev. 1:10</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478420\" id=\"p10\"><span class=\"key-word\">sacrifice</span> unto me a broken heart and a contrite spirit, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p20#p20\">3 Ne. 9:20</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/59?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">D&amp;C 59:8</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478421\" id=\"p11\"><span class=\"key-word\">immerse</span> them in the water, and come forth again, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p26#p26\">3 Ne. 11:26</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/20?lang=eng&amp;id=p74#p74\">D&amp;C 20:74</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478422\" id=\"p12\">he took of the <span class=\"key-word\">bread</span> and … blessed it, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">3 Ne. 18:3</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478423\" id=\"p13\">take of the <span class=\"key-word\">wine</span> of the cup and drink, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">3 Ne. 18:8</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478424\" id=\"p14\">bread and wine—the <span class=\"key-word\">emblems</span> of the flesh and blood, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/20?lang=eng&amp;id=p40#p40\">D&amp;C 20:40</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478425\" id=\"p15\"><span class=\"key-word\">remembering</span> … my body … and my blood, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/27?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">D&amp;C 27:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478426\" id=\"p16\">on this, the <span class=\"key-word\">Lord’s day</span>, thou shalt offer, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/59?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">D&amp;C 59:12</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/59?lang=eng&amp;id=p9-p17#p9\">59:9–17</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478427\" id=\"p17\">baptismal font was … a <span class=\"key-word\">similitude</span> of the grave, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/128?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">D&amp;C 128:13</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
